        "original_id": "228f6e85-ad63-51ff-87a0-1b3cfcc018bf",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- TV Series: Ex on the Beach (series 4), Geordie Shore, Jersey Shore\n- People: Scotty T, Lewis Good\n- Companies: MTV\n- Places: Newcastle upon Tyne, England\n- Topics: British reality television\n\nFacts:\n- Geordie Shore is a British reality television series broadcast on MTV and based in Newcastle upon Tyne, England.\n- Geordie Shore was first broadcast on 24 May 2011 and is the British version of the American show Jersey Shore.\n- Ex on the Beach series 4, a British television programme, began airing on MTV on 19 January 2016.\n- The cast of Ex on the Beach series 4 included Geordie Shore star Scotty T and Judge Geordie guest Lewis Good.\n- Ex on the Beach series 4 concluded on 8 March 2016 after eight episodes.",
